          "heading": "Blamire and Oghre shine in PREM clash amid Tuipulotu injury concern",
          "body": "Leicester's 22-16 bonus-point win at Bristol on Friday night in the PREM gave England's hooker hopefuls a showcase at Ashton Gate. Jamie Blamire, who scored for Leicester, and Gabe Oghre both starred in a set-piece battle, and Planet Rugby reckons both men \"nailed their final audition\" for next week's England training squad. Their showing came amid an injury concern to Kepu Tuipulotu ahead of the Nations Championship."
