          "heading": "Mathieu Raynal accuses World Rugby of breaking agreement over tackle laws",
          "body": "Today's press carries no fresh coverage of the dispute, so the latest reporting dates from mid-October. Referee boss Mathieu Raynal accused World Rugby of breaking an agreement as he sought clarity on how the new tackle laws would be implemented. Planet Rugby and SA Rugby Magazine both carried the story. Nothing in today's coverage shows World Rugby has issued the formal clarification that would close the matter."
