          "kicker": "Azzurrini result",
          "heading": "Italy U18 beat Ireland 36-29 in Badia Polesine after trailing at half-time",
          "body": "Italy U18 opened their season on Saturday with a 36-29 win over Ireland in Badia Polesine, matching last year's success in Cosenza. Ireland led 17-12 at half-time, despite Italy losing two players to yellow cards, the second for Nikitakos at 36 minutes, but the Azzurrini changed gear after the interval. Fanzo and Agressi scored second-half tries, with Vaccaretti converting both, and captain Mesaglio's try had opened the scoring for Italy."
        },
