        {
          "kicker": "URC result",
          "heading": "Fergus Watson opens scoring as Glasgow Warriors beat Lions 28-20",
          "body": "Scotland's Glasgow Warriors beat the Lions 28-20 in the United Rugby Championship at Scotstoun, keeping their unbeaten run alive. Fergus Watson, Player of the Match, scored the opening try off a Dan Lancaster cross-kick, and Lancaster added the second before the half-hour as the hosts led 19-3 at the break. The Lions fought back through Morne van den Berg and Morne Brandon, but Ollie Smith scored late for the hosts and a George Horne penalty denied the visitors a bonus point."
        },
