          "heading": "Carwyn Leggatt-Jones rated 7 as Scarlets fall 54-26 to Bulls in Pretoria",
          "body": "Scarlets fly-half Carwyn Leggatt-Jones earned a 7 in WalesOnline's ratings of the 54-26 defeat at the Bulls in Pretoria, where the Scarlets threatened to shock the Bulls before falling away late on. The verdict: 'Another assured performance by the young fly-half. Never hides away in attack.' WalesOnline's headline links the Scarlets showing to Wales coaches' interest, and the ratings also credit Corey Domachowski for managing 52 minutes on his return from injury."
