          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Facundo Isa recalled to Argentina squad for Ireland, replacing injured Santiago Grondona",
          "body": "Veteran Facundo Isa is back in the Argentina squad for Ireland, named in place of the injured Santiago Grondona in Contepomi's finalised 33-man roster. Isa had missed out on international duty in 2024 and 2026, and his only Argentina outing in that time came in July 2025. The recall comes amid a run of withdrawals: Thomas Gallo and Santiago Carreras were ruled out after being named, while Ignacio Ruiz and Joaquín Oviedo are also unavailable."
        },
