          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "England's Fin Smith calf injury clouds Wallabies' Nations Championship opener",
          "body": "England are fretting over Fin Smith's fitness before the Nations Championship opener against Australia. Smith damaged a calf against Leicester and cannot join the three-day camp in Bagshot. The 24-year-old started at 10 in all three of England's July Tests. With limited preparation time, there will inevitably be disruption to Steve Borthwick's plans. Gloucester's Charlie Atkinson has been called up as cover, with Marcus Smith and George Ford also in the squad. England's management say they remain hopeful Smith will be back in time to face the Wallabies."
        },
