          "body": "Japan's most recent result was a 28-34 defeat to Fiji. In their last five matches Japan have won three and lost two, and the sequence, most recent first, reads loss, win, win, win, loss. The three wins came in consecutive matches immediately before the Fiji game, and the oldest result in the window is also a defeat. The next fixture is Wales in Round 4 of the Nations Championship."
