          "heading": "Leicester Fainga'anuku's hybrid role gives Rennie bench versatility, Stephen Donald says",
          "body": "Leicester Fainga'anuku, named in the All Blacks squad for the November matches after missing the July games, could give Dave Rennie a bench with real range. Stephen Donald, speaking on The Aftermatch with Kirst and Beav, said a player who covers both loose forward and back positions could let New Zealand carry two loosies and still keep a flexible reserve. \"It gives them real freedom up front to have more impact in those ball-carrying loose forward positions,\" he said. Rennie names his team for the first Test next week."
        },
