          "heading": "Marcell Coetzee scores twice as Bulls thrash Scarlets 54-26 in Pretoria",
          "body": "Marcell Coetzee came off the bench to score twice as the Bulls beat the Scarlets 54-26 in Pretoria on Saturday, moving them into second place before the Nations Championship break. The 35-year-old replaced Cameron Hanekom early in the second half and provided the composure the Bulls needed after the Scarlets had levelled at 26-26 from 19-0 down. Grobbelaar and De Klerk also scored from the bench, and the Bulls put 28 unanswered points on the Scarlets in the final quarter."
        },
